    {
      "body": "Sanur, the \"Morning of the World,\" unveils a breathtaking moment when the sun rises, casting a golden glow on the sand and igniting the sky with color—a true masterpiece of nature. There are countless ways to start the day, but is there a better way than to savor breakfast while witnessing a natural wonder?",
      "href": "/restaurant-menu#breakfast",
      "img": "https://vold-independent.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/dining/9e66a981-3b9d-4016-8821-741d172de38b/raw/breakfastpng.png",
      "title": "Breakfast"
    },
    {
      "body": "Ever since our founder established Tandjung Sari as a family home, food has held equal importance to accommodation. Today, we continue to uphold the principles of home cooking. Created from fresh, locally grown produce and ingredients, we offer signature authentic local and international cuisine.",
      "href": "/restaurant-menu#all-day-dining",
      "img": "https://vold-independent.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/dining/7b71e37b-52fd-4665-b720-5db54111a264/raw/dsc08358-editjpg.jpeg",
      "title": "All Day Dining"
    },
    {
      "body": "Tandjung Sari's beachfront bar is the ultimate place to gather at all hours of the day. The bar menu offers a hand-picked selection of refreshments with fresh tropical flavors—whether soft, sweet, or a bit stronger. Contact us to explore our selection of wines and take advantage of special offers designed for wine enthusiasts.",
      "href": "/restaurant-menu#drinks",
      "img": "https://vold-independent.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/dining/2078dc04-924f-4bb2-b0f9-335cea4738de/raw/drinksjpg.jpeg",
      "title": "Drinks & Wines"
    }
  ],
  "hero": "https://vold-independent.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com/dining/7f8c5022-4306-42f6-a9e5-259549df949f/raw/01-ida-bagus-nyoman-rai-painting-1jpg.jpeg",
  "intro": {
    "body": "The Restaurant at Tandjung Sari offers you more than a seaside dining experience. You may choose to dine in the airy wantilan pavilion amongst Indonesian antiques or on the wooden deck under the shady camplung trees near the bar area, right on Sanur Beach. Our homemade cuisine reflects our passion for authentic local and international food, accompanied by specially crafted drinks. Open every day, from 6.30am to 11pm.",
    "title": "The Restaurant at Tandjung Sari"
  },
